To run this node, run the following commands:

    # Start this node
    ros2 launch aggregated_pointcloud aggregated_pointcloud.launch.py

    # Start depth_img_proc node to convert RGBD imagery to colored points
    ros2 run depth_image_proc point_cloud_xyz_node --ros-args --remap camera_info:=/MastCam/Front/depth/camera_info --remap image_rect:=/MastCam/Front/depth/image_rect_raw

    # Start bag playback
    ros2 bag play <path/to/perception/bag>

    # Once done should output to a ply file... somewhere......
